Subject: "Weird" Y axis for kernel density plots
Message-ID: <NOG5Wl9NU_w.FSf2P94fsdEJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/NOG5Wl9NU_w/m/FSf2P94fsdEJ>
